    "reviews": "\u201c\u201cAn amazing psychological horror with an exciting atmosphere. The intriguing story and gloomy corridors keep you in suspense. A great game for fans of mysterious and scary stories!\u201d\u201d<br> OFEN\u2122<br><br>\u201cA short PT inspired horror experience that gives mixed feelings. The ambience feels good, on the other end some jumpscares and voices feel needlessly loud compared to the ambience around.\u201d<br>Cosmic Nest<br><br>\u201cPT-style horror with strong human elements and solid design. A few bugs and minor issues, but story and experience make it worth a play. Hoping for updates to boost depth and polish.\u201d<br>Gravenox Horror Gaming<br>",
